  "macTbStep2": ["2. Pick the .tb file","2. Elige el archivo .tb","2. Choisir le fichier .tb","2. 选择 .tb 文件","2. .tb-Datei wählen","2. Scegli il file .tb","2. .tb ファイルを選択","2. .tb 파일 선택","2. Выбрать файл .tb","2. 選擇 .tb 檔案"],
  "macTbStep3": ["3. Auto Switch off → select it","3. Auto Switch desactivado → selecciónalo","3. Auto Switch désactivé → sélectionnez-le","3. 关闭 Auto Switch → 选择它","3. Auto Switch aus → auswählen","3. Auto Switch disattivato → selezionalo","3. Auto Switch オフ → 選択","3. Auto Switch 끄기 → 선택","3. Auto Switch выкл. → выбрать","3. 關閉 Auto Switch → 選取"],
  "macTbarCw": ["T-bar at 0%: turn the Dial clockwise for this fade.","T-bar al 0 %: gira el Dial en sentido horario para este fundido.","T-bar à 0 % : tournez le Dial dans le sens horaire pour ce fondu.","T-bar 位于 0%：此次淡变请顺时针转动 Dial。","T-Bar bei 0 %: Drehen Sie Dial für diese Blende im Uhrzeigersinn.","T-bar allo 0%: gira il Dial in senso orario per questa dissolvenza.","T バーは 0% です。このフェードでは Dial を時計回りに回してください。","T바 0%: 이번 페이드는 Dial을 시계 방향으로 돌리세요.","T-bar на 0 %: для этого перехода поворачивайте Dial по часовой стрелке.","T-bar 位於 0%：此次淡變請順時針轉動 Dial。"],
  "macTbarPaused": ["T-bar paused: press Side + Dial on the TourBox to reset the fader.","T-bar en pausa: pulsa Side + Dial en el TourBox para restablecer el fader.","T-bar en pause : appuyez sur Side + Dial sur le TourBox pour réinitialiser le fader.","T-bar 已暂停：在 TourBox 上按 Side + Dial 重置推子。","T-Bar pausiert: Drücken Sie am TourBox Side + Dial, um den Fader zurückzusetzen.","T-bar in pausa: premi Side + Dial sul TourBox per reimpostare il fader.","T バーが一時停止しています。TourBox の Side + Dial を押してフェーダーをリセットしてください。","T바 일시 정지: TourBox에서 Side + Dial을 눌러 페이더를 재설정하세요.","T-bar на паузе: нажмите Side + Dial на TourBox, чтобы сбросить фейдер.","T-bar 已暫停：在 TourBox 上按 Side + Dial 重設推桿。"],
  "macTourBoxInfo": ["TourBox software and info:","Software e información de TourBox:","Logiciel et infos TourBox :","TourBox 软件和信息：","TourBox-Software und Infos:","Software e info TourBox:","TourBox のソフトウェアと情報:","TourBox 소프트웨어 및 정보:","Программы и сведения TourBox:","TourBox 軟體與資訊："],
  "macUiCancel": ["Cancel","Cancelar","Annuler","取消","Abbrechen","Annulla","キャンセル","취소","Отменить","取消"],
